                }
            },
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "detach may be called explicitly, so still need to mention that?\n\n```suggestion\n                       • on_detach: Called on detach, or when ...\n```",
            "commit_id": "3ff4ba655453fcf1010faa5684fc84b38427d850",
            "created_at": "2026-08-16T10:58:32Z",
            "diff_hunk": "@@ -2402,7 +2403,9 @@ nvim_buf_attach({buf}, {send_buffer}, {opts})              *nvim_buf_attach()*\n                          • the string \"changedtick\"\n                          • buffer id\n                          • b:changedtick\n-                       • on_detach: Called on detach. Args:\n+                       • on_detach: Called when the buffer is unloaded or",
